ed a unique formula for hair taming wand that would not leave your hair hard or greasy like other hair styling products can do. It took nearly two years to perfect the award winning Smooth Stick™ which is formulated with a unique formula is enriched with hair loving ingredients including Biotin, Vitamin E, and Aloe Vera which will help nourish the hair while also keeping it in place all day long. The Smooth Stick™ has not only become a fan favourite but has also become an internet sensation as Aine has documented her small business journey online and has racked up over 95&nbsp;million views on TikTok. The company has grown from packing orders in an upstairs bedroom with her Grandad Billy, and family to becoming an internationally recognized brand in less than 18 months. The Smooth Stick™ launched in Brown Thomas and Arnotts stores in Ireland where  it sold out in just four days and most recently launched in the UK where it is now stocked on Sephora.co.uk! </p><p class="sc-kHOZwM oQMan pf-94_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">This company is dedicated to my lovely Nana Carmel, who always had a hair tip or trick up her sleeve to share.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>
